{
  "work_id": "coptic-nt/job",
  "source_path": "coptic-nt/Job.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "525cf65c74550794",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Seven sons and three daughters were born to him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "546f614ae1b862a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His sons would go together and drink every day, bringing their three sisters along to eat and drink with them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.1.21",
      "source_sha256": "8b6335e9be78685e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said, “I came naked from my mother’s womb, and I will go away naked again. The Lord gave them, and the Lord took them away. What happened was what pleased the Lord. May the Lord’s name be blessed.” In all these things that came upon him, Job did not sin at all before the Lord, nor did he attribute foolishness to God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.2.5",
      "source_sha256": "6e60cec30b5adaab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But no—stretch out your hand and touch his bones and his flesh, and see whether he will bless you to your face."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.2.13",
      "source_sha256": "95787603d51d27cc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They sat beside him for seven days and seven nights, and none of them spoke, for they saw that his suffering was severe and very great."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.3.4",
      "source_sha256": "0e80baa0707b6680",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let that night become dark. May the Lord above not seek it out, and may no light fall upon it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.3.9",
      "source_sha256": "6fbeca06b1e77b46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let the stars of that night grow dark, and let them not endure or come into the light. Let it not see the dawn rising."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.4.6",
      "source_sha256": "415ddd668ddb19cc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Isn’t your fear rooted in foolishness, and your hope in the wickedness of your way?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.4.14",
      "source_sha256": "c4ad5cab71526f98",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Terror and trembling seized me and shook my bones violently."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.5.21",
      "source_sha256": "5e8f0d752a165c3a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will hide you from the lash of the tongue, and you will not fear the evils that are coming."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.5.23",
      "source_sha256": "f30f56e9cbb2bb19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For wild beasts will obey you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.5.27",
      "source_sha256": "1faf645e33da9f62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look, we have investigated these things in this way, and these are the things we have heard."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.7.7",
      "source_sha256": "6bf03fabd2380397",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Remember that my life is a breath, and my eye will not see good things again."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.8.4",
      "source_sha256": "56ad7164916e5efd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If your children were the ones who sinned before him, he handed them over to the power of their lawlessness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.8.14",
      "source_sha256": "434e01d57fd2034c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For his house will be deserted, and his dwelling will become a spider’s web."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.9.3",
      "source_sha256": "5a131e26e076c9a2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For if he wishes to go to court with him, he will not listen to him, so that he cannot answer him with even one word from his lips."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.9.11",
      "source_sha256": "b2b4ebc963c400dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If he passes by me, I will not see him, and if he goes past me, I will not notice."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.9.23",
      "source_sha256": "3475d3c026240b8d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the wicked will die an extraordinary death, but they laugh at the righteous."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.9.30",
      "source_sha256": "2aab96a6a176d737",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For even if I wash myself in snow and cleanse myself with pure hands,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.9.34",
      "source_sha256": "875ed1d58e7e1806",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "let him take his rod off me, and do not let the fear of him terrify me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.10.8",
      "source_sha256": "fc4a7f429dd2cf2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your hands shaped me and made me; afterward, you turned and struck me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.11.7",
      "source_sha256": "7105695f397d12bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Will you find the Lord’s footsteps, or will you reach the limits of what the Almighty has made?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.11.13",
      "source_sha256": "944430fa44674cc3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But if you had purified your heart, you would have raised your hands to him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.12.7",
      "source_sha256": "5c831ba528873a22",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But ask the animals and see if they will tell you; ask the birds of the sky and see if they will inform you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.12.15",
      "source_sha256": "e13cd7fccd10701b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If he holds back the water, he will make the earth dry; and if he releases it upon the earth, he will destroy it or lay it waste."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.13.16",
      "source_sha256": "6236f9db199070a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And this will bring me salvation, for no deceit will enter his presence."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.13.17",
      "source_sha256": "2f38ebc32960a9a1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Listen, listen to my words, for I will speak while you listen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.15.6",
      "source_sha256": "1dcd010350ce3a01",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your mouth condemns you, not I, and your lips testify against you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.15.20",
      "source_sha256": "192c3c093b5a46e5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The whole life of the ungodly person is spent in anxiety, and the years allotted to a ruler are numbered."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.16.2",
      "source_sha256": "2106a67e52f3a0a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For I have heard many things like these. You are all comforters who bring trouble."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.16.13",
      "source_sha256": "825520a38a4f7f88",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They surrounded me with spears, hurling them at my kidneys without mercy. They poured my gall onto the ground."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.16.20",
      "source_sha256": "a85a6f06d21aebcc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "My plea reaches the Lord, and my eye sheds tears in his presence."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.17.8",
      "source_sha256": "385fc4f83da8481a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The truthful are astonished at this, and the righteous rise up against the sinner."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.18.17",
      "source_sha256": "9924818f840458f8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His memory will perish from the earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.20.6",
      "source_sha256": "7999fd4ce83f9729",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even if his gifts rise to heaven and his sacrifice reaches the clouds,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.20.28",
      "source_sha256": "e4959ecf0c2cbc8c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "destruction will tear his house apart, and a day of wrath is coming upon him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.21.34",
      "source_sha256": "6898e25ab3eeeb1c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How, then, can you comfort me in vain? What remains from you is nothing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.22.18",
      "source_sha256": "c6527137427b074d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yet he filled their houses with good things, but the counsel of the ungodly is far from him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.23.13",
      "source_sha256": "4961587cf867bb37",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But if he is the one who has judged me in these matters, who will answer him? For he has done what he wanted."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.25.1",
      "source_sha256": "a6c6fb52678d3048",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then Bildad the Shuhite answered and said:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.26.3",
      "source_sha256": "843c1f703f7784db",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Whom have you advised? Was it not the one to whom all wisdom belongs? Or whom have you followed? Was it not the one to whom all power belongs?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.27.3",
      "source_sha256": "698eec33ef9ebe7f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For my breath is still within me, and the holy [?] is in my nostrils."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.27.8",
      "source_sha256": "8e83b3ca12db4964",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For what hope does the ungodly person have, though he places his confidence and trust in the Lord? Will he be saved?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.29.6",
      "source_sha256": "b0c1f99ad3ac6d32",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the days when my paths flowed with butter and my mountains poured out milk,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.29.11",
      "source_sha256": "3b4a3f6fc7450338",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if an eye sees me, it turns away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.30.16",
      "source_sha256": "f748820e3f1cdd3e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I live through days of suffering."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.30.22",
      "source_sha256": "d3a477f55a49aa1e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You have placed me in suffering; you have cast me away from salvation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.31.12",
      "source_sha256": "7e9fae6e6d3a3f19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is a fire burning on every side. Whatever place it comes upon, it destroys from the root."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.31.19",
      "source_sha256": "2b0b93958359aec7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or if I neglected someone naked when he was about to perish and did not clothe him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.31.23",
      "source_sha256": "9f5d3ac183bc0bf3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for fear of the Lord held me fast."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.31.40",
      "source_sha256": "aeb092f1971d1c1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Instead of wheat growing, let it produce nettles for me, and brambles instead of barley."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.33.1",
      "source_sha256": "0602a90e3c1e9d2b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "But no—listen to my words, Job; pay attention to what I say."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.33.3",
      "source_sha256": "718cf29a355678bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "My heart is pure in its words, and the understanding of my lips will consider humble things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.33.9",
      "source_sha256": "39b366e7ae5da278",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I said, ‘I am pure; I have not sinned. I am blameless; I have committed no lawlessness.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.33.13",
      "source_sha256": "d2906a917a05f7cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "But you say, ‘Why has he not listened to my case in any matter?’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.34.18",
      "source_sha256": "4bba66daab7ea479",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The one who says to a king, ‘You are breaking the law.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.35.13",
      "source_sha256": "dd9aec59682b9f78",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For the Lord does not wish to look upon improper deeds, for he, the Almighty, watches"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.35.14",
      "source_sha256": "615bea0bd5b0f411",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "over those who commit lawless deeds, and he will save me. Submit to judgment before him, and see whether you can praise him as he is."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.36.3",
      "source_sha256": "62f27c3f8c77b568",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I have received instruction from afar, and through my deeds I will speak what is right in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.37.6",
      "source_sha256": "e0ca455c109f59e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The one who commands the snow to fall upon the earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.37.17",
      "source_sha256": "8edf337d3d4cd751",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Your clothing is warm; it lies still upon the earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.37.19",
      "source_sha256": "65872752c9d552e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "But why? Tell me, then, what to say to him, so that we may stop being so wordy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.38.5",
      "source_sha256": "4238f9d152447af1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Who set its measurements, if you know? Or who stretched a measuring line over it?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.42.15",
      "source_sha256": "f734fa8e41791212",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "No women more beautiful than Job’s daughters were found on earth. Their father gave them an inheritance among their brothers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/job#Job.42.16",
      "source_sha256": "21655ed6b89ad4a3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
